@localhost = http://localhost:8080
@render = https://cse341-project.onrender.com

########## Localhost ##########

### Home route
GET {{localhost}}/

### Get all data for the professional frontend
GET {{localhost}}/professional

### Get all contacts
# @name localContacts
GET {{localhost}}/contacts

### Get a single contact by id (uses the first id from "Get all contacts" above)
GET {{localhost}}/contacts/{{localContacts.response.body.$[0]._id}}

### Get a single contact using an id query parameter
GET {{localhost}}/contacts?id={{localContacts.response.body.$[0]._id}}

### Invalid id (400)
GET {{localhost}}/contacts/12345

### Id that does not exist (404)
GET {{localhost}}/contacts/000000000000000000000000

########## Render ##########

### Home route
GET {{render}}/

### Get all data for the professional frontend
GET {{render}}/professional

### Get all contacts
# @name renderContacts
GET {{render}}/contacts

### Get a single contact by id (uses the first id from "Get all contacts" above)
GET {{render}}/contacts/{{renderContacts.response.body.$[0]._id}}

### Get a single contact using an id query parameter
GET {{render}}/contacts?id={{renderContacts.response.body.$[0]._id}}
